<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 336 mln stg late help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 336 mln stg late help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided UK discount houses with 336 million stg of unspecified late assistance.</p>
<p>The Bank had earlier provided a total of 1.382 billion stg to the money market in response to a forecast money market shortage of 1.65 billion stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
